================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY DATA
================================================================================

`data/pruned_preprocessed_data.xlsx` and `data/GSE134358_age_sex_by_sample.tsv`
are DERIVED from NCBI GEO series GSE134358, which is third-party data and is
not covered by the licences above. The terms of the original GEO deposit apply
to that underlying data. Anyone reusing these files should cite the original
study alongside this repository.

The platform annotation GPL21572 and the raw series matrix are not redistributed
here; `biomarker_analysis/download_geo_data.py` retrieves them from NCBI.
